{"4688870":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Purrfect Bliss","steam_appid":4688870,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[4827660],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the night shift.<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purrfect Bliss is a trendy cat cafe with a terrifying secret. Your job is simple: serve the late-night regulars, brew coffee, and take care of the cafe’s four cats.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as the hours tick by, the cozy atmosphere shifts into something much darker. The shadows play tricks on you, the strict rules left by management feel increasingly sinister, and the cats are starting to act very strangely.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive the night shift?<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Barista mechanics:<\/strong> Prepare and serve coffee to your customers.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological horror:<\/strong> An intense, escalating horror experience that will leave you on edge.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive environment:<\/strong> Atmospheric graphics that pull you directly into the nightmare.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four unique cats:<\/strong> Care for the four cats, but keep a close eye on them. Their increasingly bizarre actions suggest they are more than just ordinary pets.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental mystery:<\/strong> Find hidden clues around the cafe to uncover its dark history.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the night shift.<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purrfect Bliss is a trendy cat cafe with a terrifying secret. Your job is simple: serve the late-night regulars, brew coffee, and take care of the cafe’s four cats.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as the hours tick by, the cozy atmosphere shifts into something much darker. The shadows play tricks on you, the strict rules left by management feel increasingly sinister, and the cats are starting to act very strangely.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive the night shift?<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Barista mechanics:<\/strong> Prepare and serve coffee to your customers.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological horror:<\/strong> An intense, escalating horror experience that will leave you on edge.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive environment:<\/strong> Atmospheric graphics that pull you directly into the nightmare.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four unique cats:<\/strong> Care for the four cats, but keep a close eye on them. Their increasingly bizarre actions suggest they are more than just ordinary pets.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental mystery:<\/strong> Find hidden clues around the cafe to uncover its dark history.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Purrfect Bliss is a cat cafe built on a dark history. Will you survive the night shift? Serve customers, take care of the cats, and uncover the terrifying truth in this psychological horror game.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Turkish","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4688870\/f3ffe1b18fc14db93686cc6ff1540f9e64cc625b\/header.jpg?t=1793732668","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4688870\/c451be2f4fd5936be75d29e257fbc6cd4added14\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793732668","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4688870\/c451be2f4fd5936be75d29e257fbc6cd4